                    {
                        "sense_id": "769830e7-7213-391d-8fd5-e22114be391a",
                        "entry_id": "acd53a60-073e-3368-a836-4b1d2734f97a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "親愛的，寶貝"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "09be5e52-112f-43cd-80c0-e851be70c91a",
                                "sense_id": "769830e7-7213-391d-8fd5-e22114be391a",
                                "text": "And if you actually want to see your bae – you know, like in person – You^([sic]) better set aside some of your refund check to pay for the $26 train ticket to a school that lingers outside of the tri-state area.",
                                "translation": "如果你真的想见见你的小亲亲——你知道，就是那种面对面的见面——你最好从你的退款支票中拿出一些钱来支付前往三州地区以外学校的26美元火车票。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b791e247-11f4-449c-a772-a54f72d50e96",
                                "sense_id": "769830e7-7213-391d-8fd5-e22114be391a",
                                "text": "Your newsfeed gets clogged with statuses like “Happy Valentine’s Day to my bae! I’ve loved you so much ever since we first met three months, eight days, 11 hours and 27 minutes ago!”",
                                "translation": "你的消息栏里充斥着类似这样的动态：“情人节快乐，我的宝贝！自从三个月零八天十一小时二十七分钟前我们第一次见面以来，我就一直深深地爱着你！”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "510a3f0c-5ac4-484a-a58c-7d60327ca6b3",
                                "sense_id": "769830e7-7213-391d-8fd5-e22114be391a",
                                "text": "A fresh pic of you and your bae on vacay together? Who wouldn't “like” that?!?",
                                "translation": "一张你和你的另一半一起度假的最新照片？谁会不喜欢呢？！？"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
